---
import CustomerStatement from './CustomerStatement.astro';
const steps = [
 {label:'Customer dues',title:'Start with what is owed.',description:'Open a customer statement. See the outstanding balance, credit limit and the entries behind the total.',note:'The customer owes ₹42,500 before this collection.'},
 {label:'The collection',title:'See exactly what came in.',description:'A ₹15,000 bank collection is recorded against the customer. It reduces their dues without touching the station’s drawer cash.',note:'A recorded collection, not an automatic bank feed.'},
 {label:'The statement',title:'Follow the balance back to the entry.',description:'The statement shows the collection and the ₹27,500 still outstanding. The earlier entries remain there to inspect.',note:'₹42,500 due − ₹15,000 collected = ₹27,500 outstanding.'},
 {label:'On your phone',title:'Check it yourself. Wherever you are.',description:'Open the customer’s recent entries on your phone. Check what was collected without asking someone to prepare an update.',note:'An online owner view of recorded information.'},
];
---
<section class="collection-tour" id="walkthrough" aria-labelledby="walkthrough-title" data-collection-tour>
 <div class="tour-heading"><div><p class="section-context">A closer look at customer credit</p><h2 id="walkthrough-title">“Has that customer<br />paid us yet?”</h2></div><p>Start with a question you ask every day. <br />Get to the entry that answers it.</p></div>
 <div class="tour-toolbar" hidden data-tour-controls><div class="tour-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Collection walkthrough">{steps.map((s,i) => <button type="button" role="tab" id={`tour-tab-${i}`} aria-controls={`tour-panel-${i}`} aria-selected={i===0?'true':'false'} tabindex={i===0?0:-1} data-tour-step={i}><span class="step-index" aria-hidden="true">{i+1}</span>{s.label}<span class="step-progress" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>)}</div><button type="button" class="tour-play" data-tour-play><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path class="play-glyph" d="m7 4 9 6-9 6V4Z" fill="currentColor"/><path class="pause-glyph" d="M6 4h3v12H6zm5 0h3v12h-3z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span>Play walkthrough</span></button></div>
 <div class="tour-panels">{steps.map((s,i) => <section id={`tour-panel-${i}`} class={`tour-panel tour-panel--${i}`} aria-labelledby={`tour-title-${i}`} data-tour-panel={i}><div class="tour-explanation"><p class="step-caption">{i+1} of 4 · {s.label}</p><h3 id={`tour-title-${i}`}>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.description}</p><p class="tour-explanation-note">{s.note}</p></div><div class="tour-stage">{i!==3 ? <CustomerStatement step={i} /> : <div class="owner-composition"><div class="phone-view product-replica" data-motion-detail><div class="phone-top"><span>PumpOS</span><span>Owner view · Sample</span></div><div class="phone-content"><p class="phone-section">Money</p><div class="phone-kinds"><strong>Customers</strong><span>Suppliers</span></div><div class="phone-customer"><h4>Malabar Transport</h4><strong>₹27,500.00</strong></div><div class="phone-balance"><span>Balance</span><strong>Owes you ₹27,500.00</strong></div><ul class="phone-entries"><li><div><strong>Payment received</strong><span>14 Sep 2026 · Part payment</span></div><div><strong class="collected">−₹15,000.00</strong><span>Bal ₹27,500.00</span></div></li><li><div><strong>Credit sale</strong><span>13 Sep 2026</span></div><div><strong>+₹12,500.00</strong><span>Bal ₹42,500.00</span></div></li><li><div><strong>Opening balance</strong><span>12 Sep 2026</span></div><div><strong>+₹30,000.00</strong><span>Bal ₹30,000.00</span></div></li></ul><div class="phone-bottom"><span>Overview</span><span>Shifts</span><strong>Money</strong><span>Insights</span></div></div></div><div class="owner-caption"><span class="sample-tag">Sample data</span><p>Your customer's<br />record. In your hands.</p><span>A focused illustration of the mobile customer ledger.</span></div></div>}</div></section>)}</div>
 <div class="tour-bottom"><p>Product illustrations with sample data. No real transactions are created.</p><div class="tour-navigation" data-tour-controls hidden><span class="tour-position" data-tour-position>1 / 4</span><button type="button" data-tour-back aria-label="Previous walkthrough step">←</button><button type="button" data-tour-next aria-label="Next walkthrough step">→</button></div></div><p class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-tour-status></p>
</section>
<script>
 import { initialiseCollectionTour } from '../../scripts/collection-tour';
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-collection-tour]').forEach(initialiseCollectionTour);
</script>
